WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:19.200
On Christmas morning Rabbit looked around the room.

2
00:00:19.201 --> 00:00:22.987
He was inside a stocking over a fireplace.

3
00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:27.220
Across the room stood a pretty tree.

4
00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:33.624
"Wow!" Rabbit thought. "Look at those lights!"

5
00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:36.337
He sniffed the air.

6
00:00:36.338 --> 00:00:41.214
Everything was so exciting and new here!

7
00:00:41.215 --> 00:00:44.303
Suddenly he heard footsteps.

8
00:00:44.304 --> 00:00:50.127
A boy ran down the stairs.

9
00:00:50.128 --> 00:00:53.720
"Let's open presents!" he cried.

10
00:00:53.721 --> 00:00:56.731
His parents were behind him.

11
00:00:56.732 --> 00:00:59.446
"Henry," Mom said.

12
00:00:59.447 --> 00:01:03.993
"Why don't you look in your stocking first?"

13
00:01:03.994 --> 00:01:07.670
Henry ran to the fireplace.

14
00:01:07.671 --> 00:01:11.594
He grabbed the velveteen rabbit from the stocking.

15
00:01:11.595 --> 00:01:16.389
"Look!" he cried. "A rabbit!

16
00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:27.463
He's so soft and fluffy!"

17
00:01:27.464 --> 00:01:33.540
Henry and Rabbit played all morning long.

18
00:01:33.541 --> 00:01:42.034
Rabbit was amazed by more new sights and sounds.

19
00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:47.028
He felt warm as Henry held him tightly.

20
00:01:47.029 --> 00:01:51.031
"This is so much fun!" Rabbit thought.

21
00:01:51.032 --> 00:02:00.451
"I want to play with Henry every day."

22
00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:04.978
After dinner Henry and Rabbit played some more.

23
00:02:04.979 --> 00:02:07.633
Then Dad smiled at Henry.

24
00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:10.512
"It's almost bedtime," he said.

25
00:02:10.513 --> 00:02:17.176
Henry scooped up Rabbit in his arms again.

26
00:02:17.177 --> 00:02:26.360
He brought Rabbit upstairs to a playroom.

27
00:02:26.361 --> 00:02:29.822
Henry set Rabbit on a shelf.

28
00:02:29.823 --> 00:02:32.083
"Sleep tight, Rabbit.

29
00:02:32.084 --> 00:02:39.888
We will play again tomorrow."

30
00:02:39.889 --> 00:02:43.528
Rabbit looked around as Henry left.

31
00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:45.755
He blinked in surprise.

32
00:02:45.756 --> 00:02:56.044
Other toys were staring at him!

